{"summary":"Correctly direct the flow of energy and turn on the lights","description":"Feel the electricity in your own hands playing “Power On”. Rotate the wires to ensure proper power sources can reach the lamps.\n\nCompleting the puzzle, it's time to celebrate and relax. There is no time limit: solve the puzzle at your own pace and enjoy the effects after completing the connection.\n\nPlayers say that “Power On” is anti-stress and enables meditation, as well as helping to improve their concentration.\nPower On is a relaxation and stress reduction game, so it starts with easy levels and doesn't overcomplicate it, but in case you're stuck in a level, you can always ask for a hint.\n\nSome important features:\n\nColor based game;\nStar system: Try to get all the stars;\nMore than 300 original stages;\nThere are tips available if you need a little help;\nCustomize your game area;\nDiscover the secret message behind each puzzle\n\nFinally, we suggest you play “Power On” with Haptic Feedback on, and don't forget to use your headphones to get the most out of the sensations.\n\nInfinity Games: We are experts in the minimalist and relaxing gameplay market!\nVisit us at: https://infinitygames.io","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":"$0.99 - $10.99 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/hOcdTlvjbMc?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Wmb-XXaR5Qd7UubnTT8uu3h-hH99jN7Ei9h-NSnTOyv1jUj4im1FoI6lF3gC2IJYiKU3mt-pRclVLWZaOFxqFA","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/lbgdZAIH_It7o9VmqYq4cBuBJJKgb8hmQ7DxCtT7POsZEvXvAbsLiKfE9IPT9XCngvdP9swhmidvVQetvBh1oA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/VXsh50S3yv-gZXeu291nVc3WNkLkYtxBgSceM7YxDA9oxJbqM8KERdzmeph0z8_hvnQ5aei8JmfSmPZkPNAg","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/1Bd6HgxybyL2Rwhhl0QUzjhKIAfo8Iug0EJS_1vk_FQHjGdUgI2zJSoW9-X7Ko_HKAhQCwbQm7xK1BsBFpryuA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/FZdM93gIVb4sznaVLWpHfGA8w6oCOIUIWcezwe2DWT2TEXZeY5oTWWEZOygN3